    "Reason : 1 - The proposed single-storey rear extension, by virtue of its inappropriate position and design, and excessive size and scale, would result in an increased sense of enclosure and be overbearing on the adjacent properties, which would harm the neighbours' living conditions, contrary to Local Plan Policy SC7 (Residential Extensions and Alterations), the Residential Extension Guidelines, and the principles of the National Planning Policy Framework.",
    "Reason : 2 - The proposed single-storey rear extension, by virtue of its excessive size and scale, would fail to appear proportionate to the host building and would harm the character and appearance of the local area. The proposal is therefore contrary to Local Plan Policies CC1 (Context and Character), CC2 (Urban Design and Architecture), and SC7 (Residential Extensions and Alterations); the Residential Extension Guidelines, and the principles of the National Planning Policy Framework."
